# BloomRender does not read API keys from the environment.
# Paste your Google Gemini API key in the in-app Settings panel.
# Keys are stored in the browser (localStorage) only and are never bundled.
#
# Build-time flag used by GitHub Pages deploy (set in CI, not needed locally):
# GITHUB_PAGES=true
#
# Copy this file only if you want a documented placeholder; there is nothing
# required to fill in for local development.
